WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.719 --> 00:00:05.789
From the next entries in beloved franchises
to intriguing reboots and years-in-the-making

00:00:05.789 --> 00:00:09.940
dream projects, some truly must-see releases
are starting to fill up the calendar.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.720
These are just some of the biggest films arriving
in 2021 — and beyond.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:20.440
It's been more than 20 years since a new Mortal
Kombat film hit the big screen, but one of

00:00:20.449 --> 00:00:24.939
the most popular video game franchises of
all time is finally making its way back to

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:25.440
theaters.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:26.440
"Hoo hoo hoo!

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:28.500
Yeah, now that's what I'm talkin' about!"

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:33.880
Producer James Wan who launched franchises
with Saw and The Conjuring has handed the

00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:38.410
director's chair over to first-timer Simon
McQuoid for this flick, but you can bet his

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:41.900
blockbuster pedigree will be felt throughout
the production process.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:45.680
At this point, we have no idea what the plot
of the new film will be.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:50.640
The Mortal Kombat video game franchise has
expanded significantly since Mortal Kombat:

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:56.090
Annihilation hit theaters in 1997, giving
the filmmakers an even bigger mythos to draw

00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:58.180
from as they craft their story.

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:03.000
We also don't know which fighters will be
characters in the film, or which actors will

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:08.000
play them, but we can hope to learn more soon
since the film is expected to start shooting

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:08.860
in 2019.

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:14.000
The new Mortal Kombat film is set to hit theaters
March 5th, 2021.

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:19.320
It's been more than 30 years since He-Man
and the Masters of the Universe appeared in

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:21.000
their own live-action feature film.

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:24.780
It's going to take a couple more years to
finally get the characters back on the big

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:27.220
screen, but it wasn't for lack of trying.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:32.070
A new live-action film starring He-Man and
his pals has been in the works for more than

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:36.220
a decade, and at one point it was even supposed
to be hitting theaters in 2019.

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:38.540
"I've waited a long time for this."

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:47.080
That didn't happen — but now Sony Pictures
has finally announced a March 5th, 2021 release

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:52.000
date for Masters of the Universe, which will
be directed by Band of Robbers' Adam and Aaron

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:52.500
Nee.

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:58.340
Noah Centineo, who rose to fame via Netflix's
To All The Boys I've Loved Before, has signed

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:02.710
on to play He-Man — and while we have no
idea who will play his various allies and

00:02:02.710 --> 00:02:07.830
adversaries yet, we can expect old favorites
from the animated series to show up along

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:08.320
the way.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:11.980
Let's just hope they don't show up like…
uhh… this:

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:14.640
"By the power of Grayskull!

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:16.680
Skeletor…

00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:19.500
You're so Money Super Market."

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:21.100
"Hahahahahahahahaha!"

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:27.800
The Jurassic Park franchise returned to blockbuster
status in a big way in 2015 with Jurassic

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:31.840
World, and producer Steven Spielberg wasn't
about to let it stop there.

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:36.940
Colin Trevorrow, who directed and co-wrote
the first installment, always had the shape

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:41.920
of a trilogy in his mind, and that mission
continued with Jurassic World: Fallen Kingdom

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:42.560
in 2018.

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:47.800
In keeping with the established rhythm of
one film every three years, the third installment

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:51.780
in the World trilogy is now set to arrive
on June 11th, 2021.

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:56.420
Trevorrow will return to the director's chair
for the third installment, and will co-write

00:02:56.420 --> 00:03:00.220
the film with Pacific Rim: Uprising screenwriter
Emily Carmichael.

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:04.700
Stars Chris Pratt and Bryce Dallas Howard
are also expected to return for the film,

00:03:04.709 --> 00:03:09.410
which will feature dinosaurs roaming free
on the mainland United States, making it a

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:11.180
truly Jurassic World.

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:14.600
Beyond that, we don't yet know anything about
the plot.

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:20.620
John Wick: Chapter 3 Parabellum is the most
successful entry in the franchise, surpassing

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:25.380
the entire box office runs of the two previous
installments early in its theatrical run.

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:29.960
The Wick films still clearly have a lot of
juice in them, audiences are still coming

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:35.220
back for more, and Keanu Reeves seems committed
to continuing his reign of action dominance

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:39.590
so it's no surprise that the third film perfectly
sets up a fourth installment.

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:42.380
"How can you escape from the light?"

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:43.740
"Of course.

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:47.100
You can go to the dark — but they're in
the dark too."

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:51.380
It's also no surprise that it's already been
announced.

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:57.400
John Wick: Chapter 4 is set to hit theaters
May 21st, 2021, with Reeves back once again

00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:01.790
as the titular hitman, this time going to
war against people he once thought he could

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:02.280
trust.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:06.360
We don't yet know who else will be back for
the fourth film, or who will write and direct

00:04:06.379 --> 00:04:10.760
— though director Chad Stahelski has already
expressed interest in returning.

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:15.060
What we do know is that Wick won't get any
less dangerous over the next two years.

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:20.780
The Batman has had a long road to the big
screen already, and we'll still be waiting

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:23.350
two more years until it's actually in theaters.

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:28.620
At one point the film the first solo Batman
flick since The Dark Knight Rises in 2012

00:04:28.949 --> 00:04:33.800
was supposed to be delivered by star, director,
and co-writer Ben Affleck, who'd also signed

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:37.940
on to play the Caped Crusader for Batman v
Superman: Dawn of Justice.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:43.860
But after Justice League was released in 2017,
things began to change: First Affleck seemed

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:48.520
to be backing away from work behind the camera,
ultimately giving up the directing role to

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:49.460
Matt Reeves.

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:54.440
Then he seemed to be backing away as star,
and finally revealed that he was done playing

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:55.640
Batman altogether.

00:04:55.820 --> 00:05:00.540
Ever since then, Reeves has been working to
refocus the story on a younger version of

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:01.220
the character.

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:07.310
Now, The Batman will reportedly be led by
none other than Robert Pattinson, with Reeves

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:11.860
also reportedly eyeing the Penguin and Catwoman
as his villains for the film.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:15.900
Other than that we still know very little
about where The Batman is headed, but we'll

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:17.000
find out more soon.

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:20.840
The film is slated to hit theaters June 25th,
2021.

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:27.400
For a long time, the idea that we would only
ever have three Indiana Jones films seemed

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:29.540
both comfortable and obvious.

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:34.960
Steven Spielberg, George Lucas, and Harrison
Ford spent a good chunk of the 1980s crafting

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:37.520
their trilogy, and then it seemed to be put
to bed.

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:43.040
In 2008, after years of whispers, that all
changed with the arrival of the divisive Kingdom

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:48.860
of the Crystal Skull, and in an age when franchises
and nostalgia are often king at the box office,

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:52.180
it was only a matter of time before a fifth
film materialized.

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:56.400
Indiana Jones 5 was at one point going to
arrive in 2019.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:06:00.480
Then that release date was pushed to 2020,
and then the Walt Disney Company announced

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:04.870
that the film would again be delayed, this
time to a hopefully final release date of

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:06.740
July 9th, 2021.

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:12.120
Harrison Ford will return to reprise the title
role, and Steven Spielberg will once again

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:15.640
serve as director, with Jonathan Kasdan writing
the script.

00:06:16.780 --> 00:06:21.860
25 years after the original film starring
Michael Jordan hit theaters, and after years

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:27.720
of rumors about its production, we will finally
see a new Space Jam movie in 2021.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:32.600
The original film was a defining moment for
many kids, bringing together the biggest Looney

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:38.270
Tunes stars and the biggest basketball stars,
and now LeBron James is going to do his best

00:06:38.270 --> 00:06:40.740
to walk in Jordan's footsteps with a sequel.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:44.560
"Uh, Michael… you know that your friends
are cartoon characters?"

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:47.020
"Yeah, so?"

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:49.500
"No, no… doesn't bother you, it doesn't
bother me."

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:54.380
James confirmed back in June that he's begun
shooting the film, which doesn't yet have

00:06:54.389 --> 00:06:58.740
an officially-announced plot but will likely
feature plenty of star power in the form of

00:06:58.740 --> 00:07:01.260
basketball icons and cameo appearances.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:07.759
Warner Bros. has not confirmed the film's
full cast, but NBA reporter Shams Charania

00:07:07.759 --> 00:07:12.600
reported that the NBA stars recruited for
the film include Anthony Davis, Damian Lillard,

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:13.640
and Klay Thompson.

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:21.320
Meanwhile, WNBA stars Diana Taurasi and Nneka
Ogwumike are also expected to play key roles.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:25.420
Space Jam 2 slams into theaters July 16th,
2021.

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:32.360
For a period of several months in late 2018
and early '19, James Gunn was looking for

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:36.820
new projects after he was fired by Marvel
Studios, cutting him off from the upcoming

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:39.020
Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 3.

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:44.620
Those fences have since been mended and Gunn
is back at Marvel, but in the interim he snagged

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:48.610
another comic book project over at Warner
Bros.: The Suicide Squad.

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:54.960
A new take on the anti-hero team first introduced
by director David Ayer in 2016, Gunn's follow-up

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:59.370
will focus on a new team lineup and aim for
a different tone than the original film, which

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:02.640
means we'll get a mix of new cast members
and returning stars.

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:08.980
Among those confirmed so far to be returning
are Jai Courtney as Boomerang and Viola Davis

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:13.990
as Amanda Waller, while it also seems likely
that we'll see more of Margot Robbie as Harley

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:16.200
Quinn and Joel Kinnaman as Rick Flag.

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:22.790
Newcomers include Idris Elba in a still-undisclosed
role, David Dastmalchian as Polka-Dot Man,

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:24.820
and Daniela Melchior as Ratcatcher.

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:30.139
Also reportedly attached to the project are
Gunn's Guardians pals Benicio del Toro — who'll

00:08:30.139 --> 00:08:34.739
be playing an undisclosed character — and
Michael Rooker, who'll portray King Shark.

00:08:34.739 --> 00:08:39.769
The Suicide Squad will hit theaters August
6th, 2021, nearly five years to the day after

00:08:39.769 --> 00:08:40.769
the first film.

00:08:41.789 --> 00:08:46.600
Back in April 2019, a few months after the
release of Fantastic Beasts: The Crimes of

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:51.459
Grindelwald, we learned that the third installment
in the Harry Potter prequel series will be

00:08:51.459 --> 00:08:56.320
arriving in theaters in the fall of 2021,
keeping up the Thanksgiving-adjacent release

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:58.480
schedule already established by the series.

00:08:58.749 --> 00:09:03.519
The Fantastic Beasts series, set decades before
the Potter films and starring Eddie Redmayne

00:09:03.519 --> 00:09:08.850
as wizard and magizoologist Newt Scamander,
is now setting up to chronicle the ultimate

00:09:08.850 --> 00:09:13.459
wizarding duel between Albus Dumbledore and
Gellert Grindelwald that was referenced in

00:09:13.459 --> 00:09:17.869
the Potter films — along with the true nature
of the character of Credence, who got some

00:09:17.869 --> 00:09:20.780
huge news about his ancestry in the last film.

00:09:20.980 --> 00:09:26.360
The series is set to last a total of five
films, with each one taking place primarily

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:27.300
in a different city.

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:29.620
We don't yet know what city writer J.K.

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:34.220
Rowling will take her characters to this time
around, or what the subtitle of the film will

00:09:34.230 --> 00:09:40.180
be, but we can expect return performances
from Redmanyne, Jude Law, Johnny Depp, and

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:43.149
Ezra Miller, along with the potential for
new stars.

00:09:43.149 --> 00:09:47.100
Fantastic Beasts 3 will hit theaters November
12th, 2021.

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:54.140
Nearly a decade ago, James Cameron released
Avatar, a dazzling sci-fi spectacle that captivated

00:09:54.149 --> 00:09:59.089
audiences around the world and ultimately
became the highest-grossing film of all time

00:09:59.089 --> 00:10:03.280
until Avengers: Endgame took the mantle in
July 2019.

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:08.700
Even while promoting Avatar, Cameron was already
talking about his plans for sequels, and what

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:13.180
was at the time a vision for a trilogy of
films set on the planet Pandora.

00:10:13.189 --> 00:10:18.399
Way back then, Avatar 2 and Avatar 3 were
supposed to arrive in 2014 and 2015, but that

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:19.040
didn't happen.

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:23.880
Then three sequels were happening instead
of two, with Avatar 2 arriving in 2016.

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.240
Then 2018.

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:26.100
Then 2020.

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:30.560
Now, with the purchase of Fox by the Walt
Disney Company, the release date has been

00:10:30.569 --> 00:10:36.970
moved once again to a hopefully final slot
on the calendar: December 17th, 2021, with

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:42.220
the following three sequels arriving in 2023,
2025, and 2027.

00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:46.220
Hopefully Cameron and company can meet the
deadlines they need this time, and we'll all

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:47.340
go back to Pandora.

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:53.699
Back in 2009, just as the Marvel Cinematic
Universe was heating up, Robert Downey Jr.

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:56.280
launched another franchise with Sherlock Holmes.

00:10:56.380 --> 00:11:01.500
The film, directed by Guy Ritchie and co-starring
Jude Law as Holmes' sidekick Dr. Watson, grossed

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:05.889
more than half a billion dollars worldwide
and spawned a sequel — Sherlock Holmes:

00:11:05.889 --> 00:11:07.800
A Game of Shadows — in 2011.

00:11:07.940 --> 00:11:10.120
"Are you sure you want to play this game?"

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:14.200
"I'm afraid… you'd lose."

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:18.840
After that, the Holmes franchise began to
cool down as other successful versions of

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:23.140
the character carried on their mysteries on
television through Sherlock and Elementary.

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:27.680
Law and Downey stayed busy with plenty of
acting work, and Ritchie went on to make King

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:30.040
Arthur: Legend of the Sword and Aladdin.

00:11:30.309 --> 00:11:34.519
Now, ten years after A Game of Shadows, Holmes
and Watson will ride again.

00:11:34.519 --> 00:11:39.930
Sherlock Holmes 3 is set to hit theaters on
December 22nd, 2021, a year later than the

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:42.560
original release date of Christmas Day 2020.

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:48.820
Downey and Law are both set to return as Holmes
and Watson, and Narcos' Chris Brancato is

00:11:48.820 --> 00:11:50.180
set to write the screenplay.

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:54.160
Though Ritchie is rumored to return as director
yet again, he has not yet officially signed

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:54.660
on.

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:57.460
Check out one of our newest videos right here!

00:11:57.620 --> 00:12:00.980
Plus, even more Looper videos about your favorite
stuff are coming soon.

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:04.560
Subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit the
bell so you don't miss a single one.

